{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01815","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古别离 · 王缙","name":"杂曲歌辞 古别离","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下阶欲离别，相对映兰丛。\n含辞未及吐，泪落兰丛中。\n高堂静秋日，罗衣飘暮风。\n谁能待明月，回首见牀空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王缙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}